   "narration": {
    "en": "The Proposal is a one-act play by Anton Chekhov, written in 1888-89. The three characters are Stepan Chubukov, a landowner, his twenty-five-year-old daughter Natalya, and their neighbour Ivan Lomov."
   },
   "actions": [
